---
import { ArrowUpRight, Award, CheckCircle2, Clock } from "lucide-astro";
---

<section id="personal" class="py-16 lg:py-24 w-full flex flex-col items-center">
  <div class="w-full flex flex-col gap-2.5 items-start mb-10">
    <p class="font-mono font-medium text-xs tracking-[0.6px] bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-[#DA2984] to-[#A406E9] uppercase">
      03 — PARTICULARES
    </p>
    <h2 class="font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white tracking-tight">
      Destraba tu carrera técnica hoy mismo.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-[#a0a0b4] text-base sm:text-[17px] leading-relaxed max-w-[640px]">
      El salto de la universidad o del autoaprendizaje al mercado real es difícil. Deja de acumular tutoriales y empieza a recibir feedback directo de un Senior Developer.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 w-full items-stretch">
    <div class="bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08] rounded-[20px] p-7 sm:p-9 flex flex-col justify-between gap-5 relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[#DA2984]/80 hover:bg-[linear-gradient(225deg,rgba(26,20,46,0.95)_13%,rgba(18,14,34,0.95)_86%)] hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-950/40 group min-h-[380px]">
      <div class="absolute -top-[120px] -left-[120px] w-[240px] h-[240px] rounded-full blur-[80px] bg-[#DA2984]/15 group-hover:bg-[#DA2984]/25 transition-colors duration-700 pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6">
        <div class="px-3.5 py-1.5 bg-[#DA2984]/10 border border-[#DA2984]/20 rounded-full">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#DA2984] tracking-wider uppercase">Inicial</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-[#9696af] font-mono flex items-center gap-1">
          <Clock size={12} /> 20 min gratis
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">Sesión de Claridad</h3>
        <p class="text-[#a0a0b4] text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Una llamada de 20 minutos para auditar tu enfoque profesional, revisar tu stack o guiarte en tu proyecto actual.
        </p>
      </div>

      <ul class="space-y-2.5">
        {["Auditoría rápida de tu stack", "Identificación de bloqueadores", "Consejo directo para tu carrera"].map((item) => (
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-[#a0a0b4]">
            <CheckCircle2 size={16} class="text-[#DA2984]/70 shrink-0" />
            <span>{item}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>

      <a href="https://calendly.com/tokidev/sesion-gratuita" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#DA2984] to-[#A406E9] rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-white hover:brightness-110 shadow-lg shadow-purple-900/30 transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] cursor-pointer">
        Agendar 20 min Gratis
        <ArrowUpRight size={16} />
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08] rounded-[20px] p-7 sm:p-9 flex flex-col justify-between gap-5 relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[#DA2984]/80 hover:bg-[linear-gradient(225deg,rgba(26,20,46,0.95)_13%,rgba(18,14,34,0.95)_86%)] hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-950/40 group min-h-[380px]">
      <div class="absolute -top-[120px] -left-[120px] w-[240px] h-[240px] rounded-full blur-[80px] bg-[#A406E9]/15 group-hover:bg-[#A406E9]/25 transition-colors duration-700 pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6">
        <div class="px-3.5 py-1.5 bg-[#A406E9]/10 border border-[#A406E9]/20 rounded-full">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#A406E9] tracking-wider uppercase">Avanzado</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-[#9696af] font-mono flex items-center gap-1">
          <Award size={12} class="text-[#A406E9]" /> Premium 1:1
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">Mentoría Personalizada</h3>
        <p class="text-[#a0a0b4] text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Sesiones premium enfocadas en dominar Angular, Node.js, patrones de diseño y simulación de entrevistas técnicas reales.
        </p>
      </div>

      <ul class="space-y-2.5">
        {["Revisión de código y arquitectura", "Preparación para entrevistas técnicas", "Roadmap de carrera a medida"].map((item) => (
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-[#a0a0b4]">
            <CheckCircle2 size={16} class="text-[#A406E9]/70 shrink-0" />
            <span>{item}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>

      <a href="mailto:rodrigo.torricodelcastillo@gmail.com?subject=Consulta%20disponibilidad%20mentoria%20premium" class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-3.5 bg-white/[0.07] border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/[0.12] rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-white transition-colors cursor-pointer">
        Consultar Disponibilidad
        <ArrowUpRight size={16} class="text-[#A406E9]" />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
